1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fifty-Second Episode
The Royal Wedding

15
00:01:50,541 --> 00:01:52,338
Before starting
today's episode,

16
00:01:52,381 --> 00:01:54,736
let's briefly summarize
the previous episodes.

17
00:01:54,781 --> 00:01:58,376
Grand Duke Duralumin, having become
an agent of the powerful Union X,

18
00:01:58,421 --> 00:02:00,298
pushes his petty ambition..

19
00:02:00,341 --> 00:02:03,413
..to the point of trying to kill
the King, the Queen, and Sapphire.

20
00:02:03,581 --> 00:02:06,459
But the schemer
will not succeed in his intent.

21
00:02:06,541 --> 00:02:08,452
He will die a sudden death,

22
00:02:08,501 --> 00:02:11,220
due to the betrayal of
his assistant, Baron Nylon,

23
00:02:11,261 --> 00:02:13,013
who seizes the throne.

24
00:02:13,061 --> 00:02:16,178
Nylon receives the
Union X army in the castle.

25
00:02:16,221 --> 00:02:18,894
Meanwhile Sapphire is saying goodbye
to her parents,

26
00:02:18,941 --> 00:02:21,011
locked in the room
of skeletons,

27
00:02:21,061 --> 00:02:23,291
and with three spheres of gold,
silver and copper,

28
00:02:23,341 --> 00:02:27,016
which are believed to have the power to
protect the kingdom of Silverland,

29
00:02:27,061 --> 00:02:30,690
she flees from the castle
and runs towards Goldland,

30
00:02:30,741 --> 00:02:33,414
to ask for help
from Prince Franz, but...

31
00:02:49,261 --> 00:02:51,855
What power will
these three spheres have?

32
00:02:52,541 --> 00:02:56,375
If you have any power,
magic spheres, help me now!

33
00:03:14,421 --> 00:03:16,332
Poor Sapphire...!

34
00:03:16,541 --> 00:03:20,011
Father in heaven,
I will do anything for you,

35
00:03:20,061 --> 00:03:22,291
But you, help Sapphire, please!

36
00:03:28,461 --> 00:03:31,612
Damn it!
What is this sound of bells?

37
00:03:34,741 --> 00:03:36,732
Enough! Enough!

38
00:03:42,101 --> 00:03:44,410
Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough!

39
00:03:45,381 --> 00:03:47,531
Enough! Enough! Enough!

40
00:03:49,421 --> 00:03:51,889
You have truly gone mad, Nylon!

41
00:03:52,581 --> 00:03:54,492
What is it? Speak!

42
00:03:54,541 --> 00:03:57,851
I have come to tell you about the bells!
They are being rung by the people,

43
00:03:57,901 --> 00:04:00,415
who are lamenting because
the King and Queen are dead.

44
00:04:00,621 --> 00:04:03,693
What?!
Destroy all the bells!

45
00:04:03,741 --> 00:04:06,175
And find Sapphire
as soon as possible!

46
00:04:06,221 --> 00:04:09,133
Whether it be on a mountain,
valley, village... anywhere!

47
00:04:09,181 --> 00:04:11,570
If it is necessary,
destroy the mountains!

48
00:04:11,621 --> 00:04:15,899
Destroy all the places where it is
possible that Sapphire is hiding!

49
00:04:50,901 --> 00:04:53,131
Our poor old city!

50
00:04:53,301 --> 00:04:55,895
Union X has destroyed everything!

51
00:04:56,221 --> 00:04:58,655
But you see that Sapphire
will defeat them!

52
00:05:01,541 --> 00:05:03,850
Sapphire has lost
her father and mother,

53
00:05:03,901 --> 00:05:06,176
but she has Prince Franz with her

54
00:05:09,901 --> 00:05:14,053
Come, there is a surprise!
But first blindfold your eyes!

55
00:05:38,261 --> 00:05:40,900
Check that everything is in order,
old owl!

56
00:05:42,821 --> 00:05:45,051
And you, get ready, fireflies!

57
00:05:50,701 --> 00:05:54,091
What you are about to see is a gift
for you from your forest friends!

58
00:05:54,141 --> 00:05:55,893
Take off your blindfolds!

59
00:06:02,581 --> 00:06:04,412
It’s truly delightful!

60
00:06:05,061 --> 00:06:06,813
It’s magnificent!

61
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:35,935
Sapphire, do you like the gift
that we are giving you from the heart?

62
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:38,815
I like it very much!
You have been so kind!

63
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:41,252
I’m glad you like it!

64
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:44,259
But now, keep watching:
there is another gift for you.

65
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:47,019
Go!

66
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:35,813
Sapphire!

67
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:46,297
Forest friends,
I’m sorry if I wandered away.

68
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:50,216
Forgive me,
but I feel so weak!

69
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:53,697
I am trying to fight back,
but I always feel a great sadness!

70
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:00,018
I always feel like crying.

71
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:02,655
How much I would like to see
my father and my mother again..!

72
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:12,254
We understand you, Sapphire,
and we also suffer so much with you.

73
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:24,292
Heavenly Father,
I will do whatever you want,

74
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:27,094
but I beg you,
grant my wish!

75
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:29,018
I beg you, heavenly Father!

76
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:31,416
Give Sapphire back
her father and her mother!

77
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:34,214
Bring them back to life for her!
Grant my wish!

78
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:37,332
Please! I won't ask you
for anything else, I promise!

79
00:08:49,901 --> 00:08:52,210
It's you, Heavenly Father!

80
00:08:52,821 --> 00:08:56,097
Tink, once you were an angel,

81
00:08:56,141 --> 00:08:59,736
but your wishes cannot
be easily granted.

82
00:09:00,381 --> 00:09:02,576
If you wish to help
those you love,

83
00:09:02,621 --> 00:09:04,657
you will have to sacrifice yourself to help them.

84
00:09:05,021 --> 00:09:08,172
I will see how many sacrifices
you will have faced for them...

85
00:09:08,221 --> 00:09:10,940
and I will decide whether to grant
your wish.

86
00:09:13,461 --> 00:09:17,170
I will work for Sapphire!
I will do anything for her!

87
00:09:26,621 --> 00:09:28,532
Oh, so much good stuff! Thank you!

88
00:09:28,581 --> 00:09:31,015
I'm sure Sapphire will
be very happy about it!

89
00:09:31,261 --> 00:09:33,013
What?!

90
00:09:33,581 --> 00:09:36,015
And what are these?
Who brought them?

91
00:09:37,061 --> 00:09:39,621
Are you telling me that you
found them, little mouse?

92
00:09:39,901 --> 00:09:42,256
I'm sorry,
but they aren't edible.

93
00:09:42,701 --> 00:09:46,410
I've got it! They could serve
as a clapper for our bells!

94
00:09:46,461 --> 00:09:48,929
That way I'll wake up Sapphire!
Oh, Opal!

95
00:09:50,701 --> 00:09:54,011
I understand, these three spheres
are very precious to Sapphire.

96
00:09:54,061 --> 00:09:56,131
But couldn't you leave
them with me for a while?

97
00:09:56,181 --> 00:09:58,490
I'll ring the bells
and wake up Sapphire!

98
00:09:58,541 --> 00:10:01,009
I'll be careful not to
break them, don't worry!

99
00:10:01,181 --> 00:10:03,331
What do you say, Opal?

100
00:10:05,221 --> 00:10:07,212
Thank you!

101
00:10:11,021 --> 00:10:13,489
Ready? Now let's hear how they sound!

102
00:10:15,701 --> 00:10:18,090
The bells are ringing by themselves!

103
00:10:31,741 --> 00:10:34,335
Did you hang the spheres
inside the bells?

104
00:10:34,741 --> 00:10:38,131
Is it true that those three spheres
have great magical power?

105
00:10:38,181 --> 00:10:40,695
Yes! Those three spheres
will protect Silverland,

106
00:10:40,741 --> 00:10:42,891
the Royal Family and the people!

107
00:10:53,541 --> 00:10:56,374
- These are the bells!
- What? - Listen!

108
00:11:01,261 --> 00:11:04,219
The bells! The bells!

109
00:11:08,261 --> 00:11:10,092
What is this sound?

110
00:11:10,141 --> 00:11:12,496
I told you
to destroy all the bells!

111
00:11:12,541 --> 00:11:14,816
Your order
has been carried out, master!

112
00:11:15,101 --> 00:11:18,411
This sound...
My head hurts!

113
00:11:18,501 --> 00:11:22,779
It's deafening me! Go and destroy
these ringing bells!

114
00:11:24,101 --> 00:11:27,650
Look! The broken bells
are moving!

115
00:11:27,821 --> 00:11:29,254
Help!

116
00:11:43,101 --> 00:11:45,490
My arms
feel like fighting!

117
00:11:45,541 --> 00:11:48,009
I also feel
full of energy again!

118
00:11:48,061 --> 00:11:51,497
Sapphire, let's fight!
Let's drive X away! Let's all fight!

119
00:11:52,221 --> 00:11:54,689
Yes, let's fight!

120
00:11:54,741 --> 00:11:57,414
The bells are performing
the miracle!

121
00:12:05,381 --> 00:12:07,690
The magic bells are for us!

122
00:12:07,901 --> 00:12:10,574
Let's attack the army
of Union X!

123
00:12:10,941 --> 00:12:13,774
- Yes, let's fight!
- Forward!

124
00:12:15,421 --> 00:12:17,139
Let's go, Opal!

125
00:12:32,021 --> 00:12:35,013
Bell, ring louder!

126
00:12:46,741 --> 00:12:51,098
How stupid they are! They
will never defeat us! Advance!

127
00:12:57,941 --> 00:13:00,091
Forward, destroy them!

128
00:13:27,661 --> 00:13:32,018
Hurrah! Hooray! Victory! Hurrah!

129
00:13:46,541 --> 00:13:48,338
Damn it!

130
00:13:59,261 --> 00:14:01,172
It serves you right!

131
00:14:11,621 --> 00:14:15,819
- Tink!
- Sapphire, the spheres are safe!

132
00:14:18,581 --> 00:14:21,414
Help! Let's take shelter!

133
00:14:35,541 --> 00:14:38,135
Damn it!
We've locked ourselves in here!

134
00:14:38,221 --> 00:14:41,019
It's over for us!

135
00:14:41,061 --> 00:14:43,814
Don't worry! I know
the way out of this cave.

136
00:14:43,861 --> 00:14:46,091
We will come out near the castle.

137
00:14:46,181 --> 00:14:49,457
But this is a stroke of luck!
I could get into the castle...

138
00:14:49,501 --> 00:14:52,811
...and try to kill X!
Please, look for a weapon!

139
00:14:52,861 --> 00:14:56,456
All we need is a weapon, that
way we can retake the castle!

140
00:14:56,501 --> 00:14:58,890
I've got it: let's build it
with the three spheres!

141
00:14:58,941 --> 00:15:02,217
Right! Right! We are the
best blacksmiths in the world!

142
00:15:02,261 --> 00:15:04,616
Yes, it's true! It seems
like a good idea to me!

143
00:15:04,661 --> 00:15:07,733
Tink is the one who has the three
spheres. But where is he? Tink! Tink!

144
00:15:08,141 --> 00:15:11,099
- Tink! Tink!
- Tink, where are you? Tink!

145
00:15:12,501 --> 00:15:14,731
Tink!

146
00:15:18,501 --> 00:15:20,492
What hard work!

147
00:15:20,541 --> 00:15:23,101
Goodness, they are so hard!

148
00:15:25,861 --> 00:15:28,329
Tink! We were
looking for you! Let's go!

149
00:15:29,101 --> 00:15:30,614
Tink!

150
00:15:33,181 --> 00:15:38,209
I was just trying to build a
weapon with these three spheres.

151
00:15:38,301 --> 00:15:40,496
Thank you for the thought, Tink.

152
00:15:40,541 --> 00:15:43,374
Now we will show you what
great blacksmiths we are.

153
00:15:43,421 --> 00:15:45,013
You'll see!

154
00:16:02,861 --> 00:16:04,897
How marvelous!

155
00:16:08,021 --> 00:16:10,899
- It looks like a magic weapon!
- Here you go, Tink!

156
00:16:10,941 --> 00:16:13,375
- What is it? A trumpet?!
- That trumpet must have...

157
00:16:13,421 --> 00:16:15,252
...the same power as the bells!

158
00:16:15,301 --> 00:16:17,371
We made it with
the leftover gold!

159
00:16:21,301 --> 00:16:24,498
- Wait here, please!
- Sapphire!

160
00:16:29,461 --> 00:16:31,770
Stand back! I'll
take care of them!

161
00:16:32,421 --> 00:16:34,332
Wait, Franz!

162
00:16:41,821 --> 00:16:43,413
Sapphire!

163
00:16:49,661 --> 00:16:52,016
A knight is approaching!
It's Sapphire!

164
00:16:52,301 --> 00:16:54,019
Fire!

165
00:17:04,421 --> 00:17:05,900
Sapphire!

166
00:17:08,461 --> 00:17:10,258
Watch out!

167
00:17:10,301 --> 00:17:13,338
- Thank you, Franz!
- Throw the magic axe, Sapphire!

168
00:17:36,501 --> 00:17:38,617
It's the magic power of the spheres!

169
00:17:38,661 --> 00:17:41,494
Now is the time to attack
the army of Union X!

170
00:17:41,541 --> 00:17:43,816
Here we go! Go, Sapphire!

171
00:17:51,101 --> 00:17:53,171
Cursed Sapphire!

172
00:18:09,821 --> 00:18:13,450
- Sapphire! - Now I can avenge
my parents!

173
00:18:37,101 --> 00:18:38,659
Sapphire!

174
00:18:51,341 --> 00:18:55,380
Father in heaven, don't let Sapphire die!
Please, help her!

175
00:19:01,461 --> 00:19:03,611
X is dead, Sapphire!

176
00:19:31,181 --> 00:19:32,660
Watch out!

177
00:19:35,461 --> 00:19:37,213
Tink!

178
00:19:40,101 --> 00:19:42,410
Long live the great X!

179
00:19:51,541 --> 00:19:53,418
Tink! Tink!

180
00:19:57,501 --> 00:20:02,734
Tink! Tink..! Don't die!
Please, don't die!

181
00:20:04,261 --> 00:20:06,695
Sapphire, it's time to say goodbye.

182
00:20:06,741 --> 00:20:10,450
The Father in heaven is calling me,
so now I must go.

183
00:20:10,501 --> 00:20:13,015
I won't let you go!
You will stay with me!

184
00:20:13,061 --> 00:20:16,019
Father in heaven, I have done
everything to help Sapphire.

185
00:20:16,061 --> 00:20:18,336
Will you grant
my wish now?

186
00:20:19,141 --> 00:20:21,211
Alright, Tink.

187
00:20:21,621 --> 00:20:24,089
I will grant your wish.

188
00:20:24,381 --> 00:20:27,691
I will send Sapphire's father and mother
to Earth.

189
00:20:28,021 --> 00:20:30,251
...and I will send them in your place,

190
00:20:30,301 --> 00:20:33,134
while you will return to heaven,
beside me.

191
00:20:36,701 --> 00:20:39,010
Heavenly Father, thank you.

192
00:21:22,021 --> 00:21:23,818
Mom! Dad!

193
00:21:23,861 --> 00:21:26,011
- Sapphire!
- My daughter!

194
00:21:26,061 --> 00:21:28,211
Mom! Dad!

195
00:22:12,541 --> 00:22:14,418
I am an angel once again.

196
00:22:14,461 --> 00:22:16,895
On Earth, since then,
many years have passed.

197
00:22:16,941 --> 00:22:19,853
I imagine that you, now,
will want to know what became...

198
00:22:19,901 --> 00:22:23,735
...of the kingdom of Silverland,
of Sapphire and Franz, isn't that right?

199
00:22:24,101 --> 00:22:27,411
Let's see! Silverland has
regained its former beauty...

200
00:22:27,461 --> 00:22:29,497
...and everyone leads a happy life.

201
00:22:55,621 --> 00:22:58,135
So, Sapphire,
are you ready to go out?

202
00:23:03,421 --> 00:23:06,777
Yes!
I'm more than ready!

203
00:23:14,501 --> 00:23:17,140
I see that Sapphire and
Franz will marry soon.

204
00:23:17,301 --> 00:23:19,451
I'm sure they will be
a beautiful couple!

205
00:23:19,501 --> 00:23:21,651
They will live happily all their lives!

206
00:23:22,141 --> 00:23:24,416
I will ask the Heavenly
Father to be able to attend...

207
00:23:24,461 --> 00:23:26,531
...their wedding.

208
00:24:27,021 --> 00:24:30,641
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

209
00:24:30,642 --> 00:24:34,002
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

210
00:24:34,003 --> 00:24:37,773
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

211
00:24:37,774 --> 00:24:40,935
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

212
00:24:40,936 --> 00:24:44,749
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

213
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:48,046
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

214
00:24:48,047 --> 00:24:52,052
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

215
00:24:52,053 --> 00:24:55,491
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

216
00:24:55,492 --> 00:24:59,112
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

217
00:24:59,113 --> 00:25:02,473
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

218
00:25:02,474 --> 00:25:06,244
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

219
00:25:06,245 --> 00:25:09,406
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

220
00:25:09,430 --> 00:25:20,977
